<title>USA: York Financial sets 10 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>York Financial sets 10 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>York Financial Corp said Friday that it will pay a stock dividend of 10 percent on November 15 with its regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.15 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable to stockholders of record November 4, the company said.</p>
<p>York Financial is the parent of York Federal Savings and Loan Association.</p>
